<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>통학 방법 비교기 Pro - 신입생 스마트 통학 길잡이</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Chart.js CDN for Step 9 Visual Analytics -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Noto Sans KR Font -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Noto Sans KR', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#eef2ff',
                            100: '#e0e7ff',
                            500: '#6366f1',
                            600: '#4f46e5',
                            700: '#4338ca',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 4px;
            height: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: transparent;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 9999px;
        }
        .dark ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #475569;
        }
        .break-keep {
            word-break: keep-all;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white transition-colors duration-200">

    <div class="max-w-md w-full mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-2xl relative border-x border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 transition-colors duration-200">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 to-violet-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/20">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-route text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                        <h1 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">통학 방법 비교기</h1>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800">PRO</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">패스할인·피로도·시급환산 스마트 분석</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action Buttons: Dark Mode, Backup/Share, Reset -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <button id="btnToggleTheme" onclick="toggleTheme()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-amber-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 transition flex items-center justify-center" title="다크 모드 전환" aria-label="다크 모드 전환">
                    <i id="themeIcon" class="fa-solid fa-moon text-xs"></i>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openDataModal()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 transition flex items-center justify-center" title="데이터 백업 및 공유" aria-label="데이터 관리">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-share-nodes text-xs"></i>
                </button>
                <button id="btnResetDefaults" class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 active:scale-95 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50/60 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition flex items-center space-x-1" title="기본 가상 데이터 5개로 복원">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-rotate-left text-[10px]"></i>
                    <span>초기화</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto pb-24 p-4 space-y-4">

            <!-- SCREEN 1: 비교 홈 (화면 1) -->
            <section id="viewComparison" class="space-y-3.5">
                
                <!-- 8단계: 오늘의 상황 & 내 성향 필터 아코디언 -->
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-700/80 shadow-xs overflow-hidden transition-colors">
                    <button type="button" onclick="togglePreferenceAccordion()" class="w-full px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between text-left hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/40 transition">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-950 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i>
                            </span>
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 block">오늘의 상황 & 내 성향 맞춤 필터</span>
                                <span id="activePreferenceSummary" class="text-[11px] text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-semibold">프로 지각러 모드 · 맑음 ☀️</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <i id="accordionChevron" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200"></i>
                    </button>

                    <div id="preferenceAccordionBody" class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-3 hidden">
                        <!-- 성향 프리셋 3종 -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 block mb-1.5">나의 통학 성향 선택 (Smart Score 가중치)</label>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5">
                                <button type="button" onclick="setPersonaMode('TIME_FIRST')" data-persona="TIME_FIRST" class="persona-btn p-2 rounded-xl border text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="text-xs">🏃‍♂️</span>
                                        <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/60 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300">시간 70%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-1.5">
                                        <p class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">프로 지각러</p>
                                        <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400">비용10·피로20</p>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setPersonaMode('COST_FIRST')" data-persona="COST_FIRST" class="persona-btn p-2 rounded-xl border text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="text-xs">🪙</span>
                                        <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">비용 70%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-1.5">
                                        <p class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">짠테크 모드</p>
                                        <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400">시간20·피로10</p>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setPersonaMode('COMFORT_FIRST')" data-persona="COMFORT_FIRST" class="persona-btn p-2 rounded-xl border text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="text-xs">🔋</span>
                                        <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/60 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">체력 70%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-1.5">
                                        <p class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">체력 보존</p>
                                        <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400">시간20·비용10</p>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 비/눈 오는 날 시뮬레이터 토글 -->
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <span id="weatherEmoji" class="text-base">☔</span>
                                <div>
                                    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">비/눈 오는 날 시뮬레이터</p>
                                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">자전거 및 도보 15분 이상 경로 피로도 급상승·점수 감점</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" id="btnRainToggle" onclick="toggleRainyMode()" role="switch" aria-checked="false" class="w-11 h-6 bg-slate-300 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded-full relative transition-colors duration-200 focus:outline-none shrink-0">
                                <span id="rainToggleKnob" class="w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full shadow-xs absolute top-1 left-1 transition-transform duration-200"></span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 한 달 등교 일수 & 6단계 교통패스 할인 설정 카드 -->
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-700/80 p-4 shadow-xs space-y-3.5 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600"></span>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">등교 일수 & 교통패스 할인 설정</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 font-semibold bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-100 dark:border-indigo-800">
                            왕복(편도×2) 기준
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 등교 일수 조절 -->
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 shrink-0">
                            <button type="button" onclick="adjustSchoolDays(-1)" aria-label="등교 일수 1일 감소" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 font-bold flex items-center justify-center transition shadow-2xs">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-minus text-xs"></i>
                            </button>
                            <div class="w-14 text-center select-none">
                                <span id="displaySchoolDays" class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">20</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">일</span>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" onclick="adjustSchoolDays(1)" aria-label="등교 일수 1일 증가" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 font-bold flex items-center justify-center transition shadow-2xs">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 shrink-0 overflow-x-auto">
                            <button type="button" onclick="setSchoolDays(12)" class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-2 py-1.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-indigo-600 active:scale-95 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 transition">주3일(12일)</button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setSchoolDays(16)" class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-2 py-1.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-indigo-600 active:scale-95 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 transition">주4일(16일)</button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setSchoolDays(20)" class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-2 py-1.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-indigo-600 active:scale-95 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 transition">주5일(20일)</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 6단계: 한국형 교통패스 할인 옵션 -->
                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket text-indigo-500 mr-1.5"></i>교통패스 할인 적용
                            </span>
                            <span id="passStatusHint" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400">월 15회 이상 조건 충족</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5 text-xs">
                            <button type="button" onclick="setPassType('NONE')" data-pass="NONE" class="pass-btn py-2 px-2 rounded-xl border text-center transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold">적용 안 함</span>
                                <span class="text-[9px] opacity-75">일반 요금</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setPassType('KPASS')" data-pass="KPASS" class="pass-btn py-2 px-2 rounded-xl border text-center transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold">K-패스 (청년)</span>
                                <span class="text-[9px] opacity-80">30% 환급(15회↑)</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setPassType('CLIMATE')" data-pass="CLIMATE" class="pass-btn py-2 px-2 rounded-xl border text-center transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold">기후동행 청년</span>
                                <span class="text-[9px] opacity-80">월 55,000원 상한</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Best Pick 요약 배너: 시간 1위 vs 비용 1위 추천 -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
                    <!-- 가장 빠른 방법 -->
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 to-indigo-950 rounded-2xl p-3 text-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between border border-blue-800/40">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 text-blue-200 text-[11px] font-semibold mb-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-300"></i>
                                <span>가장 빠른 방법</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 id="bestTimeName" class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white truncate">분석 중...</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/10 flex items-baseline justify-between">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-300">편도 시간</span>
                            <span id="bestTimeVal" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300">-</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 가장 아끼는 방법 -->
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900 to-teal-950 rounded-2xl p-3 text-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between border border-emerald-800/40">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 text-emerald-200 text-[11px] font-semibold mb-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-piggy-bank text-emerald-300"></i>
                                <span>가장 아끼는 방법</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 id="bestCostName" class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white truncate">분석 중...</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/10 flex items-baseline justify-between">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-300">한 달 실교통비</span>
                            <span id="bestCostVal" class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300">-</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 정렬 기준 선택 탭 (5종: 맞춤 추천순, 시간 우선, 비용 우선, 쾌적순, 환승 적은 순) -->
                <div class="pt-1 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">비교 결과 목록</h2>
                            <span id="routeCountBadge" class="text-xs text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-100 dark:border-indigo-800">0개</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">정렬 기준 선택</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Filter Buttons -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1 bg-slate-200/80 dark:bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-medium">
                        <button class="sort-tab py-1.5 rounded-lg transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 shadow-xs font-bold" data-sort="SCORE">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles text-[10px]"></i>
                            <span>추천순</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="sort-tab py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-0.5" data-sort="TIME">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-[10px]"></i>
                            <span>시간순</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="sort-tab py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-0.5" data-sort="COST">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-won-sign text-[10px]"></i>
                            <span>비용순</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="sort-tab py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-0.5" data-sort="FATIGUE">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-face-smile text-[10px]"></i>
                            <span>쾌적순</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="sort-tab py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-0.5" data-sort="TRANSFERS">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shuffle text-[10px]"></i>
                            <span>환승순</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Dynamic Route Cards Container -->
                <div id="routeListContainer" class="space-y-3">
                    <!-- Populated dynamically via JS -->
                </div>

                <!-- Empty State -->
                <div id="emptyRoutesState" class="hidden bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl py-12 px-4 text-center">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-indigo-500 mb-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bus-simple text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">등록된 통학 방법이 없습니다</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">하단 '방법 추가' 탭에서 새로운 통학 경로를 추가해 보세요.</p>
                </div>

            </section>

            <!-- SCREEN 2: 새 통학 방법 등록 & 수정 폼 (화면 2) -->
            <section id="viewAddRoute" class="space-y-4 hidden">
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-700/80 p-5 shadow-xs space-y-4 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h2 id="formHeaderTitle" class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">새 통학 방법 추가</h2>
                            <p id="formHeaderSubtitle" class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">비교할 통학 수단 및 피로도·도보 정보를 입력하세요.</p>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" id="btnCancelEdit" onclick="cancelEditRoute()" class="hidden text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/60 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 hover:bg-rose-100 transition">
